And that relates to 18 US code subsection 2071,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:45.920
the concealment, removal and mutilation&nbsp;
generally. And it says that if indeed one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:51.840
is found guilty of mishandling documents in this&nbsp;
