00:05:52.480 --> 00:06:00.080
the penalty is forfeiture of public office and&nbsp;
disqualification from holding any office under the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:05.920
United States. That's potentially what is at play&nbsp;
here, assuming that this involves the mishandling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:12.080
or unauthorized removal of classified information.&nbsp;
And if they find those elements at Mar a Lago,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:18.080
the substance of the documents is less important.&nbsp;
It's the fact that they were classified and that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:24.480
